WEBVTT

00:05:39.619 --> 00:05:41.328
Hvala vam.

00:05:41.328 --> 00:05:43.610
EDI: Hvala vam!

00:05:43.610 --> 00:05:45.520
(Aplauz)

00:05:45.520 --> 00:05:52.241
(Muzika)

00:05:52.241 --> 00:05:54.050
MT: To je sve. Hvala vam mnogo,

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:56.841
i hvala tebi, EDI.
EDI: Hvala ti, Marko.

00:05:56.841 --> 00:06:00.841
(Aplauz)